                    Barbershop Website + Booking System
                </h2>

                <p class="lead mt-4">
                    A professional website and booking platform designed to help a barbershop
                    get appointments, manage customers, and look trusted online.
                </p>

                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li>✓ Customer Booking</li>
                    <li>✓ Barber Dashboard</li>
                    <li>✓ Manager Portal</li>
                    <li>✓ Mobile Friendly</li>
                    <li>✓ Website Care Ready</li>
                </ul>

